#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/spectral-bias-figure1a.md:15
msgid ""
"The paper-scale aggregate trains ten six-layer networks for 80,000 full-"
"batch Adam updates each. The bundled graph is a single-phase interactive "
"entry point."
