#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/spectral-bias-figure1a.md:50
msgid ""
"This example reproduces the equal-amplitude experiment in Figure 1(a) of "
"Rahaman et al. Ten independently phased six-layer ReLU networks fit a "
"one-dimensional target made from ten equal-amplitude sine waves. The "
"aggregated DFT heatmap shows the same ordering as the paper: low-"
"frequency components reach their target amplitude before high-frequency "
"components. The layer-weight panel follows the public notebook's "
"calculation. Its layer-to-layer shape differs from the target panel and "
"is reported separately."
msgstr ""
"本示例复现 Rahaman 等人 Figure 1(a) 中的等幅实验。十个相位彼此独立的六层 ReLU 网络拟合由十个等幅正弦波构成的一维目标函数。汇总后的 "
"DFT 热图呈现与论文相同的顺序：低频分量比高频分量更早达到目标幅值。逐层权重面板沿用公开 notebook "
"中的计算方法；它在层间的形状与目标面板不同，故另行报告。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/spectral-bias-figure1a.md:59
msgid ""
"**Paper:** [On the Spectral Bias of Neural "
"Networks](https://arxiv.org/abs/1806.08734)"
msgstr "**论文：** [On the Spectral Bias of Neural Networks](https://arxiv.org/abs/1806.08734)"

