msgid ""
"The paper and appendix specify 80,000 updates. The current public "
"notebook defaults to 60,000. This reproduction follows the paper horizon "
"and uses the notebook's endpoint-excluded input grid, network semantics, "
"optimizer, DFT formula, and layer-weight expression."
