#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/spectral-bias-figure1a.md:129
msgid ""
"Comfy Research Fourier-component visualization nodes for the lowest and "
"highest frequencies in the ten-phase aggregate."
msgstr "Comfy Research 的 Fourier 分量可视化节点，展示十次相位聚合中的最低频和最高频。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/spectral-bias-figure1a.md:133
msgid ""
"**Frequency endpoints.** The $k=5$ component reaches its target near the "
"start of training. The $k=50$ component rises across most of the "
"80,000-update run."
msgstr "**频率端点。** $k=5$ 分量在训练开始阶段达到目标；$k=50$ 分量在 80,000 次更新的大部分时间里持续上升。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/spectral-bias-figure1a.md:137
msgid ""
"Comfy Research visualization nodes for the middle-frequency component and"
" the spectral norms of six layer-weight matrices."
msgstr "Comfy Research 的中频分量和六个层权重矩阵谱范数可视化节点。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/spectral-bias-figure1a.md:141
msgid ""
"**Middle frequency and layer diagnostic.** The $k=25$ component reaches "
"its target between the two endpoint frequencies. The adjacent node shows "
"the six layer-weight spectral-norm series from the same ten-phase "
"aggregate."
msgstr "**中频和层诊断。** $k=25$ 分量在两个端点频率之间达到目标，旁边节点展示同一十次相位聚合中六个层权重的谱范数序列。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/spectral-bias-figure1a.md:146
msgid ""
"At the final recorded point, update 79,900, the ten mean amplitudes "
"ranged from 0.9437 to 1.0069. All target components were nearly fitted by"
" the end, and their learning onsets remained strongly ordered by "
"frequency."
msgstr ""
"在最后一个记录点，即第 79,900 次更新时，十个平均幅值介于 0.9437 至 1.0069 "
"之间。到训练结束时，所有目标分量都已接近拟合完成，且学习起始时刻仍明显按频率排序。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/spectral-bias-figure1a.md:150
msgid ""
"The public-notebook layer-weight calculation produced overall growth in "
"the four square hidden layers. Its final means were 537.39, 337.99, "
"455.25, and 660.57. The scale overlaps the paper. The stronger layer "
"separation and Layer 5 dominance resemble the right panel of Figure 1(b) "
"more than Figure 1(a). This difference is listed in the limitations."
msgstr ""
"公开 notebook 中的逐层权重计算显示，四个方形隐藏层的权重总体增长，最终均值分别为 537.39、337.99、455.25 和 "
"660.57。其量级与论文结果相近。更明显的层间差异以及 Layer 5 的主导地位，与其说像 Figure 1(a)，不如说更接近 Figure "
"1(b) 的右图。此差异列于局限性中。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/spectral-bias-figure1a.md:156
msgid "Interpretation"
msgstr "解释"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/spectral-bias-figure1a.md:158
msgid ""
"Across ten phase draws, the ReLU network fits the smooth, low-frequency "
"structure before the rapidly varying, high-frequency structure. The "
"aggregate reproduces the reported spectral ordering."
msgstr "在十次相位抽样中，ReLU 网络先拟合平滑的低频结构，随后才拟合快速变化的高频结构。汇总结果复现了论文报告的频谱顺序。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/spectral-bias-figure1a.md:162
msgid ""
"High-frequency components are eventually fitted, with later threshold "
"crossings under this configuration."
msgstr "高频分量最终也会被拟合，但在这一配置下会更晚越过阈值。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/spectral-bias-figure1a.md:165
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "局限性"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/spectral-bias-figure1a.md:167
msgid ""
"The layer-weight panel differs visibly from the target Figure 1(a) panel,"
" despite using the public notebook expression."
msgstr "尽管采用公开 notebook 中的表达式，逐层权重面板仍与目标 Figure 1(a) 面板存在明显差异。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/spectral-bias-figure1a.md:169
msgid ""
"One source array contains a non-finite Layer 4 point at update 64,500. It"
" is shown as missing, with no replacement or interpolation."
msgstr "一个源数组在第 64,500 次更新处包含非有限的 Layer 4 值。图中将其显示为缺失值，未作替换或插值。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/spectral-bias-figure1a.md:171
msgid ""
"Figure 1(b), architecture and optimizer ablations, and the paper's real-"
"dataset experiments are outside this reproduction."
msgstr "Figure 1(b)、架构和优化器的消融实验，以及论文中的真实数据集实验，均不在本次复现范围内。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/spectral-bias-figure1a.md:173
msgid ""
"Ten runs support the ordering for this controlled target. The causal "
"mechanism for spectral bias remains outside the scope."
msgstr "十次运行支持这一受控目标中的频率排序。频谱偏置背后的因果机制不在本次复现范围内。"
